Sebelum optimasi, lo harus tau dulu query mana yang lambat:
-----------------------------

-- Tambahkan EXPLAIN ANALYZE di depan query
EXPLAIN ANALYZE
SELECT * FROM transaksi_masuk
WHERE id_barang = 5
AND tanggal_masuk >= '2024-01-01';
```

### Baca hasilnya:
```
Seq Scan on transaksi_masuk  
  (cost=0.00..1250.00 rows=50 width=200)  
  (actual time=0.043..85.231 rows=50 loops=1)
  Filter: (id_barang = 5)
  Rows Removed by Filter: 99950  ← 99.950 baris discarded!

Planning Time: 0.5 ms
Execution Time: 85.4 ms  ← LAMBAT!

-------------------------------
Seq Scan = tanda bahaya, dia baca semua baris!
Rows Removed by Filter = makin besar makin boros.